# Title: High-Reliability Hardware Development for Industrial & Specialized Scenarios

## Overview

Stability, low latency and high adaptability are core requirements for hardware deployed in industrial and special-purpose working environments.

With years of accumulated experience in hardware R&D, Xi’an Qiyun Zhixun Electronic Technology Co., Ltd. focuses on embedded computing, multi-channel data acquisition, real-time 4K/8K audio & video processing and industrial-grade board development. We deliver high-reliability hardware solutions for harsh operating conditions.

## Our Technical Services

- Custom hardware solution design, schematic & PCB layout, SI/PI/EMC simulation and optimization
- FPGA-based video/image processing, real-time signal processing and edge computing hardware development
- Prototype debugging, firmware development and system-level verification & testing
- Full-cycle technical support from prototype validation to batch production

We do not adopt templated, generic development. Every solution is customized and optimized based on actual application scenarios, operating conditions and cost targets to satisfy industrial deployment requirements.

We welcome long-term cooperation with hardware R&D teams and technical outsourcing partners. Feel free to contact us for technical discussions.

